Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.06,0:01:06.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《猛鬼街》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.00,0:01:38.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蒂娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tina...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.01,0:01:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蒂娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tina!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.12,0:03:42.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧  蒂娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You OK, Tina?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.22,0:03:45.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是做了一个恶梦  妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a dream, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.22,0:03:49.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做了一个疯狂的恶梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some dream, judging from that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.23,0:03:55.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到床上来  老婆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You coming back to the sack or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.23,0:03:59.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你先回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.24,0:04:03.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蒂娜  你必须修剪指甲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tina, honey, you got to cut your fingernails...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.24,0:04:05.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就可以不做恶梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or you got to stop that kind of dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.24,0:04:09.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其中一个必须做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One or the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.30,0:04:21.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一  二  佛莱迪要来抓你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One... two... Freddy's coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.30,0:04:26.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三  四  锁好你的门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three... four... Better lock your door.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.71,0:04:31.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五  六  快去拿十字架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five... six... Grab your crucifix.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.31,0:04:36.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七  八  彻夜不眠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven... eight... Gonna stay up late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.22,0:04:39.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九  十  永远不要睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine... ten... Never sleep again...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.22,0:04:41.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was so scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.30,0:04:43.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我醒来后他好像还在房间内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I woke up...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.40,0:04:45.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像传说中的妖怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seemed like he was still in the room with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.10,0:04:46.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是一个鬼怪专程来找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sounds like a real bogeyman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.34,0:04:48.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一  二  佛莱迪要来抓你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"One... two... Freddy's coming for you."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.11,0:04:52.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那使我想起那一首跳绳童谣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what it reminded me of... that old jump rope song.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.20,0:04:53.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我所做过最可怕的恶梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was the worst nightmare I ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.65,0:04:55.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定不会相信的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.11,0:04:57.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上我自己也做了一个恶梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a matter of fact, I had a bad dream last night myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.12,0:05:00.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今天早上起床时勃起  蒂娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a hard-on this morning when I woke up, Tina.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.12,0:05:02.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你的名字一直在我脑中盘旋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had your name written all over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.12,0:05:03.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的名字有4个字母  罗德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's four letters in my name, Rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.70,0:05:07.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么想的都是4个字母的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could there be room on your joint for four letters?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.13,0:05:11.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你有个美梦  罗德真会卖乖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Up yours with a twirling lawnmower. Rod says the sweetest things.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.13,0:05:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他很可爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's nuts about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.01,0:05:14.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  是讨人厌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, nuts. Anyway...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.40,0:05:18.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说真的  我昨晚无法入眠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't go back to sleep last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.80,0:05:20.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做了什么梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what did you dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.40,0:05:21.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忘了它吧  蒂娜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget it, Tina.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.40,0:05:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人偶尔都会做梦的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The point is that everyone has a bad dream once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.40,0:05:25.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是什么严重的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's no biggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.40,0:05:27.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次你再做恶梦时  就跟自己说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next time you're having one, just tell yourself...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.41,0:05:28.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当你遇到时才是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's all it is right while you're having it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.77,0:05:30.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过了之后就没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once you do that, you wake right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.44,0:05:35.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少我是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least, it works for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.42,0:05:40.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也做了恶梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you have a nightmare, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.42,0:05:44.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许快要有大地震了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we're going to have a big earthquake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.42,0:05:48.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传说在地震前都会变的怪怪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say things get really weird just before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.43,0:05:56.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真高兴你们今天晚上到我家来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so glad you guys could come over tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.44,0:05:58.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听我妈说她要离开几天时  我担心死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When my mom said she was taking off for two days, I almost died.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.44,0:06:00.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不必怕  蒂娜  南希和格伦来搭救你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No problem, Tina. Nancy and Glen to the rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.44,0:06:03.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不敢相信他妈说他也做恶梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe his mother's letting him spend the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.45,0:06:10.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是  事实上她不是这意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, well... she's not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.88,0:06:13.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上次我到机场接我表弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, I got this cousin who lives near the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.45,0:06:14.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想暂时住在我家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's OK for me to stay with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.45,0:06:17.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗德给我这一盒录音带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I got this sound effects tape from Rod...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.46,0:06:20.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈罗  妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.46,0:06:24.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  贝利如何了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Out here at Barry's.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.46,0:06:27.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  和以前一样吵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, noisy as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.47,0:06:29.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好你没住在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glad we don't live here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.43,0:06:32.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  享利在向你打招呼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aunt Eunice says hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.47,0:06:35.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  我明早打电话给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll call you in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.47,0:06:39.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  对  好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.48,0:06:43.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面有一些小鬼在开快车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just some kids drag racing outside, I think, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.25,0:06:44.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈  我要走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, Mom. I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.98,0:06:46.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面好像有车祸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think there's been an accident out front.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.49,0:06:53.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  我去叫警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I'll call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.49,0:06:58.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  我去叫警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll call the police!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.43,0:07:00.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  只是邻居们在吵架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just some neighbors having a fight, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.93,0:07:02.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.50,0:07:06.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明早打电话给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll call you in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.51,0:07:12.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真像巫师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It worked like a charm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.91,0:07:14.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.51,0:07:16.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.52,0:07:20.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看  我说过你会好一点的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See? I told you you'd be feeling better.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.52,0:07:24.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直看到那家伙的怪异脸孔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All day long I've been seeing that guy's weird face...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.52,0:07:27.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,常出现在他的指甲旁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and hearing those fingernails.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.53,0:07:29.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,指甲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fingernails?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.53,0:07:31.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真令我感到意外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's amazing you saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.53,0:07:34.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我昨晚也做了一个同样的梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That made me remember the dream I had last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.53,0:07:36.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做了什么梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.54,0:07:40.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我梦到一个穿着红绿相间毛衣的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dreamed about a guy in a dirty red and green sweater.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.54,0:07:45.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,指甲呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the fingernails?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.54,0:07:49.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了指甲还有其他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He scraped his fingernails along things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.55,0:07:52.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实  那些指甲更像是刀片\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, they were more like finger-knives...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.02,0:07:54.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来是自制的  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}something he made himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.55,0:07:56.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还发出怪声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they made a horrible sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.89,0:07:58.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来就像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was like...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.56,0:08:01.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希  你和我梦到的怪胎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You dreamed about the same creep I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.56,0:08:09.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.57,0:08:12.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.57,0:08:13.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.57,0:08:16.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面有东西是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something out there, isn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.58,0:08:18.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没听到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't hear anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.58,0:08:22.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.61,0:08:57.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你是谁  我要你见光死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to punch out your lights, whoever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.62,0:09:05.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喵喵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kitty, kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.66,0:09:12.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汪汪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chow, chow, chow?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.64,0:09:20.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗德在三尺之外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Rod Lane bringing Lantz down...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.64,0:09:22.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于把格伦推到在地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just three yards from the goal line!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.64,0:09:25.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是一次漂亮的转倒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a brilliant tackle, and the fans go wild!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.64,0:09:26.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这里做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.88,0:09:29.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是个恶作剧  不必在意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Came to make up. No big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.65,0:09:30.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你妈在吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mom home?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.65,0:09:32.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然在  那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.65,0:09:37.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很可怕是不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Intense, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:42.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里怎么回事  不狂欢了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on here, an orgy or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.13,0:09:44.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许有葬礼  呆子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe a funeral, dickhead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:46.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是来陪蒂娜  罗德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a sleep-over date, Rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.67,0:09:47.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是来陪蒂娜  格伦刚要离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tina and me. Glen was just leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.67,0:09:52.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到他那样子没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see his face?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.57,0:09:57.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你妈不在家  对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mom ain't home, is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.68,0:10:00.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我和蒂娜有事要谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me and Tina got stuff to discuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.68,0:10:05.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们可以到她房间的床休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got her mother's bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.98,0:10:07.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们自便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys got the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.69,0:10:14.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我们应该离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we should get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.69,0:10:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不是要留下吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys are going to hang around, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.70,0:10:20.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要把我和这疯子留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't leave me alone with this lunatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.70,0:10:24.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你  南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, Nancy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.71,0:10:31.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格伦  现在不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glen, not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.71,0:10:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要陪着蒂娜  不要太自私\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're here for Tina now, not ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.72,0:10:40.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她为什么老是被可笑的恶梦困扰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why is she so bothered by a stupid nightmare anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.72,0:10:44.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为她很怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because he was scary, that's why!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.76,0:11:27.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,道德沦亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morality sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.78,0:11:40.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道我喜欢你某一些优点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew there was something about you I liked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.88,0:11:42.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得好一点了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You feel better now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.78,0:11:46.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是天作之合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jungle man fix Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.79,0:11:49.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不再吵架了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more fights?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.79,0:11:51.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不再吵架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.79,0:11:57.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚上睡觉不再做恶梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more nightmares for either one of us, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:12:01.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么时候做过恶梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When did you have a nightmare?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.80,0:12:05.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男人也会做恶梦  你知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys can have nightmares, too, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.80,0:12:09.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能靠购物来减压\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ain't got a corner on the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.91,0:13:49.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.91,0:13:53.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.98,0:15:04.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.01,0:15:31.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.27,0:15:58.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.05,0:16:10.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上帝  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, God...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.05,0:16:12.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.05,0:16:16.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is God.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.07,0:16:40.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.09,0:16:51.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希  快开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy! Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.54,0:17:09.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗德  救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rod, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.11,0:17:16.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救我  罗德  救我  罗德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help me, Rod!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.16,0:18:07.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要杀了你  是谁干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who did this? I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.17,0:18:07.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底谁干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.83,0:18:10.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪  你吓死我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You scared me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.19,0:18:29.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么资料  她叫蒂娜  格雷  那是她家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you got? Her name was Tina Gray. It was her home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.19,0:18:32.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她父亲十年前离家出走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father abandoned, 10 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.19,0:18:33.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母亲和男友在拉斯维加斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother's in Vegas with a boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.19,0:18:34.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们正在想办法联络他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're trying to reach her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.19,0:18:36.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,验尸官怎么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the coroner got?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.46,0:18:38.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该是被利器所杀  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something like a razor was the weapon...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.96,0:18:41.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但现场没发现任何凶器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but nothing was found at the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.20,0:18:43.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一看之下好像是被男友害的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks like the victim's boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.20,0:18:44.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant, where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.20,0:18:45.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带她到你的办公室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I put her in your office.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.20,0:18:47.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫罗德蓝尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name's Rod Lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.21,0:18:48.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,热爱音乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a musician type.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.91,0:18:51.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曾因吸毒和打架被捕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been arrested for drugs, brawling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.21,0:18:53.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了  他在那里做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Terrific. What the hell was she doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.21,0:18:54.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他住哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She lived there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.68,0:18:58.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是说他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't mean her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.22,0:19:00.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.22,0:19:04.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在那里做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was she doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.22,0:19:06.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好  唐诺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello to you, too, Donald.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.22,0:19:10.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马奇  没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marge. OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.23,0:19:16.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉如何  宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doing, baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.23,0:19:20.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事  爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm OK, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.20,0:19:22.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  我要了解情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I don't want to get into this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.21,0:19:23.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要一点时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God knows you need time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.24,0:19:25.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我最想知道的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I sure would like to know what the hell you were doing...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.24,0:19:26.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么在三更半夜和三个小孩子鬼混\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shacking up with three kids in the middle of the night...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.25,0:19:31.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特别是和那个丧心病狂的蓝尔一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}especially a lunatic delinquent like Lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.25,0:19:34.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗德不是丧心病狂  爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rod is not a lunatic, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.25,0:19:38.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对他所做的有何解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a sane explanation for what he did?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.76,0:19:41.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,显然他是妒而发狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently, he was crazy jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.26,0:19:43.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希说他们在吵架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy said they'd had a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.26,0:19:45.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并没那么严重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't that serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.26,0:19:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许你不认为谋杀是严重的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you don't think murder is serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.27,0:19:51.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道那会变成严重的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you say I don't take her death seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.10,0:19:58.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, all I meant...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.28,0:20:02.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们并不是吵得那么严重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was that their fights weren't that serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.28,0:20:07.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗  蒂娜她  她梦到这可能会发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know Tina dreamed this was going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.72,0:20:11.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.22,0:20:14.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她有一个恶梦  有人想杀她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'd had a nightmare that someone was trying to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.30,0:20:21.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我们才到她家  妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why we were there, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.30,0:20:25.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不敢一个  人睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She just didn't want to sleep alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.00,0:20:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警方说15岁的蒂娜·格雷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Police say the victim, 15-year-old Christina Gray...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.00,0:20:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曾和男友罗德蓝尔争吵过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had quarreled earlier with her boyfriend Rod Lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.00,0:20:40.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝尔现在被囚禁于市立看守所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lane is now the subject of a citywide manhunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.90,0:20:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至于杀人凶器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The murder weapon...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.60,0:20:43.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,估计是某种利刃  但至今仍未找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a straight razor or similar sharp object, has not yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.00,0:20:52.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.00,0:20:54.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To school.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.00,0:20:56.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亲爱的  我们昨晚谈了一夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, you were tossing and turning all night last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.00,0:20:58.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道今天最好不要上学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no business going to school today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.01,0:21:00.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须要去学校  妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got to go to school, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.01,0:21:02.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则我坐在那里会发疯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otherwise, I'll sit up there and go crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.31,0:21:04.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有没有睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.14,0:21:08.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我到图书室去睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll sleep in study hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.02,0:21:11.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我宁愿自己忙一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd rather keep busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.45,0:21:13.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放学就马上回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right home after?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.42,0:21:15.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right home after.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.02,0:21:20.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.06,0:22:00.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会伤害你  不会伤害你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going to hurt you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.07,0:22:04.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会杀死我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're going to kill me for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.07,0:22:08.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人会杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody's going to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.30,0:22:10.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你做的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.30,0:22:12.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我根本没碰到她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never touched her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.30,0:22:14.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你像疯子似地尖叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were screaming like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.30,0:22:16.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那房间里有个  人在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was somebody else there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.30,0:22:18.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,房门是从里面锁着的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The door was locked from your side!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.31,0:22:21.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要用那种好像我是杀人狂的眼神看我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look at me like I'm some fucking fruitcake!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.31,0:22:22.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我信任你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm warning you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.31,0:22:25.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要碰她  小鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just move away from her, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.31,0:22:29.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要你不要乱动就没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Real easy, like your ass depended on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.32,0:22:30.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.32,0:22:35.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.33,0:22:43.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住不要动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.53,0:22:44.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.33,0:22:46.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  我逮到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.33,0:22:48.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趴在地上  快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got him. On the ground! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.27,0:22:49.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来  趴下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.70,0:22:51.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长  看这个  是弹簧刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant, look at this! A switchblade!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.34,0:22:54.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我干的  我没杀她  南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't do it! I didn't kill her, Nancy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.34,0:22:57.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸  你竟然利用我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy? You used me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.35,0:22:59.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这是要干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell were you doing...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.65,0:23:01.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天还要回学校吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}going to school today for anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.35,0:23:09.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go of my arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.36,0:23:13.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你所看到的  有时不是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is seen is not always what is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.36,0:23:15.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根据莎士比亚的说法  大自然之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to Shakespeare, there was something operating...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.96,0:23:22.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至是人的本性中  都有腐败的部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in nature, perhaps inside human nature itself, that was rotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.37,0:23:26.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他称之为"腐败源头"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"A canker," as he put it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.37,0:23:28.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈姆雷特因此而走入魔道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, Hamlet's response to this...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.38,0:23:30.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对于母亲撒的谎  他不断去查探\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and to his mother's lies was to continually probe and dig.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.38,0:23:38.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像挖墓一样  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like the gravediggers...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.39,0:23:41.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不断往下挖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}always trying to get beneath the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.39,0:23:43.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却有点不同  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The same is true in a different way...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.52,0:23:44.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在凯撒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in Julius Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.39,0:23:48.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,约翰  请念下一段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John, will you go ahead, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.40,0:23:57.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在罗马最鼎盛之时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"In the most high and palmy state of Rome...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.41,0:24:00.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯撒大帝却突然驾崩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little ere the mightiest Julius fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.01,0:24:02.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他未能安然入土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The grave stood tenantless...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.41,0:24:04.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遗体在罗马的大街小巷中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the sheeted dead did squeak and gibber...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.71,0:24:06.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,默默诉怨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the Roman streets."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.41,0:24:09.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星宿带着烈焰  充斥着血腥味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"As stars with trains of fire and dues of blood...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.42,0:24:12.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太阳使得空气无比闷热\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"disaster's in the sun and the moist air...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.02,0:24:14.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,受海王星支配的帝国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"upon whose influence Neptune's empire stands..."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.70,0:24:30.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Oh, God, I could be bounded in a nutshell...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.11,0:24:35.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我愿困在坚壳中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"and count myself a king of infinite space...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.10,0:24:39.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自诩为无尽宇宙的君王  在那里  不会再有恶梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"were it not that I have bad dreams."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.15,0:25:28.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的早退条呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's your pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.16,0:25:32.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别烦我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Screw your pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.10,0:25:37.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希  不准在走廊奔跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Nancy! No running in the hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.40,0:27:03.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.00,0:27:52.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gonna get you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.10,0:28:02.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这只是一场恶梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's only a dream!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.10,0:28:04.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来佛莱迪这儿吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come to Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.10,0:28:08.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.11,0:28:17.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事了  南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK! OK! Thompson!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.11,0:28:20.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫你妈来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll call your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.12,0:28:23.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything is all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.12,0:28:27.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坐下  不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.60,0:28:29.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.60,0:28:31.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.60,0:28:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.50,0:28:34.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go straight home.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.60,0:28:38.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要早退条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll need a hall pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.61,0:28:44.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续上课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.66,0:29:37.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.67,0:29:40.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.67,0:29:43.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时很暗  但我确定有个人在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was dark, but I'm sure there was somebody in there...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.67,0:29:44.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在床单下面和她在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}under the covers with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.67,0:29:46.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会有个人在床单下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could somebody be under the covers with you guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.68,0:29:49.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么会不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without you knowing about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.81,0:29:51.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么会知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How the fuck do I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.68,0:29:55.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正我不期望你相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't expect you to believe me anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.68,0:29:59.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那人长什么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did he look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.69,0:30:03.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没看到他吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you get a look at him?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.69,0:30:10.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你怎么知道被子下面有个人在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then how do you know that somebody else was there?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.70,0:30:13.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我看到有人在用东西割她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because somebody cut her while I watched.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.70,0:30:15.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你却没看到凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you didn't get a look at him?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.70,0:30:17.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看不到那混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't even see the fucker.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.71,0:30:20.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只看得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could just see...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.71,0:30:23.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,割的情形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cuts happening...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.71,0:30:24.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突然出现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.71,0:30:28.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"突然出现"是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean all at once?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.72,0:30:32.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像是有四把利刃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was as if there were four razors...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.72,0:30:37.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同时在割她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cutting her at the same time...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.73,0:30:40.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但看不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but invisible ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.86,0:30:45.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想我可以救她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I probably could have saved her...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.73,0:30:49.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但己来不及了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I'd have moved sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.74,0:30:52.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我后来想这可能是恶梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I thought it was just another nightmare...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.74,0:30:56.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和我前几天做的恶梦一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like the one I had the night before.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.75,0:31:02.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那个  人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.75,0:31:07.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他有像刀子的指甲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had knives for fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.76,0:31:20.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还认为是我干的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.79,0:31:41.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一  二  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One... two...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.72,0:31:43.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佛莱迪要来抓你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freddy's coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.79,0:31:46.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三  四  锁好你的门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three... four...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.76,0:31:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好把门锁紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better lock your door.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.80,0:31:52.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五  六  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five... six...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.53,0:31:56.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去拿十字架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab your crucifix.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.80,0:31:57.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七  八  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven... eight...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.37,0:32:02.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彻夜不眠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gonna stay up late.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.81,0:32:06.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九  十  你会睡不着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine... ten...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.01,0:32:10.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远不要睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never sleep... again.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.83,0:32:28.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事  妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.40,0:32:29.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洗澡时别睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't fall asleep in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.84,0:32:31.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会被溺死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could drown, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.84,0:32:33.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, for Pete's sakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.40,0:32:34.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种事常有发生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It happens all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.84,0:32:36.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为你泡了热牛奶  亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've heated up some warm milk for you, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.84,0:32:38.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,热牛奶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warm milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.00,0:32:43.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没兴趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.13,0:33:14.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.55,0:33:30.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坚持住  宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.55,0:33:34.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.55,0:33:38.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.56,0:33:40.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 还好吗  - 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're OK? - I'm OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.56,0:33:43.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听到你在叫救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I heard you screaming. You were calling me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.56,0:33:47.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是滑到浴池底下了  妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just slipped getting out of the tub, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.56,0:33:49.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I told you...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.60,0:33:50.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多人这样而溺死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hundreds of people a year get killed like that, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.57,0:33:52.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道  我没事  妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, but I'm OK, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.57,0:33:54.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  吓着了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry for scaring you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.57,0:33:58.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要紧  我帮你铺床好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll turn down your bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.58,0:34:02.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  我先去换睡衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get my pajamas on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.77,0:34:26.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把躯体一块块进行肢解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...the act of bodily dismemberment.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.65,0:35:09.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起  我看到你的灯还亮着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. I saw your light was on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.65,0:35:10.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以来看看你情况如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I'd see how you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.65,0:35:13.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时我希望你不是住在对街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes I wish you didn't live right across the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.65,0:35:15.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要说了  让我进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you shut up and let me in?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.75,0:35:16.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赤脚站在花棚上可不舒服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you ever stand on a trellis in your bare feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.65,0:35:19.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁没人发现快点进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get inside before somebody sees you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.66,0:35:22.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我撞到头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hit my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.79,0:35:24.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小声一点  我妈还没睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotta be quiet. Mom's not even asleep yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.73,0:35:30.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果您不介意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.68,0:35:41.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说昨天上英文课时你突然尖叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I heard you freaked out in English class today.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.68,0:35:43.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I guess I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.68,0:35:46.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还没睡吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You haven't slept yet, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.12,0:35:47.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.68,0:35:49.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的手怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you do to your arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.69,0:35:53.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上英文课时烫伤的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I burned it in English class.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.69,0:36:01.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天  我已经二十岁  了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God. I look 20 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.70,0:36:06.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你昨晚是否有做奇怪的梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you have any weird dreams last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.70,0:36:08.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我睡得跟死猪一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slept like a rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.71,0:36:10.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你相信人可以  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you believe that people...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.51,0:36:12.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梦到将发生的事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can dream about what's going to happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.71,0:36:16.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.71,0:36:18.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你相信有鬼怪存在吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you believe in the bogeyman?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.85,0:36:19.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.72,0:36:23.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗德杀了蒂娜  你知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rod killed Tina, and you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.72,0:36:26.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你帮我个大忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got a crazy favor to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.72,0:36:29.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很容易的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nothing hard or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.73,0:36:33.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去找一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna go and look for somebody...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.73,0:36:38.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你当我的警卫  好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I want you to stand... like a sort of a guard, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.74,0:36:46.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千万别搞砸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you can't mess up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.74,0:36:48.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这件事很重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot might depend on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.75,0:36:50.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会搞砸的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't screw up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.75,0:36:54.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把灯关掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turn off the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.75,0:36:58.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  我们的计划是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's what we're going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.92,0:37:00.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里好黑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's dark in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.76,0:37:04.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要想歪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's not what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.81,0:37:59.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还在看吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you still watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.82,0:38:01.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. So?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.82,0:38:05.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是想确定一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just checking.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.93,0:39:52.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.93,0:39:54.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.80,0:40:28.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醒醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.30,0:40:30.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还在吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.31,0:40:34.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.34,0:41:04.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希  救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy, help me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.34,0:41:08.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save me from...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.01,0:41:09.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佛莱迪来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.32,0:41:21.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.36,0:41:22.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是个梦  不是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.32,0:41:23.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.86,0:41:28.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.41,0:42:19.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格伦  你这混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glen, you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.42,0:42:20.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.42,0:42:23.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只要你帮我做一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just asked you to do one thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.49,0:42:25.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是叫你看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just stay awake and watch me...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.69,0:42:28.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一做恶梦时你就把我叫醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just wake me up if it looked like I was having a bad dream...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.42,0:42:31.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.06,0:42:32.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这混球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.43,0:42:33.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你竟然睡着了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.43,0:42:36.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.87,0:42:38.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.43,0:42:42.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留在这里  不要离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up and stay there. Don't go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.30,0:42:49.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.77,0:42:52.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事  我只是做梦而己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. It was just a little dream, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.31,0:42:53.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要继续睡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going right back to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.31,0:42:57.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  有需要随时叫我好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call me if you need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.60,0:43:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我发生什么事好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mind telling me what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.60,0:43:20.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.10,0:43:21.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加西亚  我必须再看罗德一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Garcia, I've got to see Rod Lane again.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.00,0:43:26.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我说  我值夜班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I took the night shift...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.10,0:43:27.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望能得到一点宁静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I could get some peace and quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.64,0:43:28.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这件事很紧急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's urgent!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.12,0:43:47.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有理由相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have reason to believe that there might be...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.12,0:43:49.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里将会发生非常奇怪的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}something very strange going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.13,0:43:51.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用再说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got no argument with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.13,0:43:53.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.13,0:43:54.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是杀人嫌疑犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's an unsolved murder...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.20,0:43:55.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最讨厌那种人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I don't like unsolved murders...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.13,0:43:58.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会把我的女儿给带坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}especially ones that my daughter's mixed up in.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.13,0:43:59.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这里干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.14,0:44:01.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这时候你应该在家里睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At this hour, you should be home in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.14,0:44:03.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只是来看他是否安好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want to see if he's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.14,0:44:05.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希  相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy, take my word for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.14,0:44:06.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙像个婴儿熟睡着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guy's sleeping like a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.14,0:44:10.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不会乱跑的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.15,0:44:20.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下去看一下好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just go down and look at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.16,0:44:23.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你  爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.16,0:44:25.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.16,0:44:27.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加西亚  钥匙给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Garcia, give me the keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.16,0:44:30.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.17,0:44:34.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钥匙在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell did I put the keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.19,0:44:52.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.20,0:45:05.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸  老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.21,0:45:13.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把他放下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.21,0:45:15.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓住他的腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab his legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.18,0:45:17.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我抓住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.42,0:45:24.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓他的背部  你会吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab his back, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.39,0:45:25.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lower him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.25,0:45:51.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尘归尘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ashes to ashes...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.38,0:45:52.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,土归土\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dust to dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.25,0:45:57.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿上帝保佑这个年轻的灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May God be with this young man's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.25,0:46:00.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的生与死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His life and his death...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.39,0:46:03.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是为圣经作证言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}attest to the scriptures' warning...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.26,0:46:05.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生死之瞬间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he who lives by the sword shall die by the sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.16,0:46:08.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  我们要记住它的警告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But let us recall also our Lord's admonition...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.63,0:46:14.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不审判人  就不会被审判\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we judge not, lest we be judged.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.77,0:46:21.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿罗德蓝尔安息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And may Rod Lane rest in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.28,0:46:29.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该走了  亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to go, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.29,0:46:37.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hop in.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.29,0:46:40.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀人者还逍遥法外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The killer's still loose, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.36,0:46:43.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说杀蒂娜的另有他人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're saying somebody else killed Tina?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.30,0:46:45.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.30,0:46:47.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道他是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know who he is...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.30,0:46:50.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他被烧焦  他头上戴顶奇怪的帽子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he's burned, and he wears a weird hat...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.31,0:46:54.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿着件肮脏的红绿毛衣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a red and green sweater, really dirty...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.31,0:47:01.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的巨大手指像刀子一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he uses these knives, like giant fingernails.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.32,0:47:06.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好让她待在家里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better keep her home for a few days...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.32,0:47:09.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等几天之后她恢复神智\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until she really gets over the shock of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.33,0:47:10.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有个更好的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got something better.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.33,0:47:14.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要求找人帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to get her some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.09,0:47:39.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们可不可以给我一些  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't see why you couldn't just give me a pill...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.09,0:47:41.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会做梦的药丸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to keep me from dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.09,0:47:43.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每个人都会做梦  小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone's got to dream, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.09,0:47:46.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不做梦  那表示没救了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you don't dream, you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.10,0:47:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All set.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.10,0:47:53.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心  南希  信任我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, Nancy, trust us.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.10,0:47:57.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是不信任  只是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not you I don't trust. It's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.11,0:48:09.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试就试吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.12,0:48:16.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你  护士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, nurse.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.14,0:48:33.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她何时开始这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long has this been going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.48,0:48:35.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自从凶案发生后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since the murders.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.81,0:48:37.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前她都没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was fine before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.15,0:48:40.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在她以为她的梦是真实的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now she thinks her dreams are real.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.15,0:48:43.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的脑电图没有问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no sign of pathology in her EEG.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.15,0:48:47.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来只是因为出事后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd guess that what we have is just a normal girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.16,0:48:51.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她吓坏了才会这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who happens to have gone through two days of hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.33,0:49:01.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她睡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's asleep now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.17,0:49:05.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.18,0:49:09.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是什么梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are dreams anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.18,0:49:10.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mysteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.38,0:49:12.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是人体的奥秘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incredible body hocus-pocus.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.18,0:49:15.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上我们不知道梦是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truth is we still don't know what they are...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.18,0:49:19.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不知道梦从何而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or where they come from.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.20,0:49:30.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她进入深睡状态了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's going into deep sleep now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.20,0:49:33.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心跳速度快了一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heart rate is a little high.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.70,0:49:35.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是因为紧张而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just due to anxiety.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.20,0:49:38.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大致上还是很放松的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otherwise, she's nicely relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.21,0:49:39.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他一切正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All signs are normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.21,0:49:43.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她现在会随时做梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She could dream at any time now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.22,0:49:50.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脑波缓慢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beta waves are slowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.22,0:49:56.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼球正快速转动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's into REMs now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.23,0:49:57.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在正在做梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's definitely dreaming now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.79,0:50:00.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a good one, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.83,0:50:02.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,典型的梦形态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Typical dream parameter.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.23,0:50:07.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶梦通常会跳至正负五至六\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A nightmare now would be plus or minus five or six.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.24,0:50:12.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她只到三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's about three.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.25,0:50:19.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,医生  她现在怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doctor, what's she doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.85,0:50:22.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是睡着还是醒着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is she asleep or awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.25,0:50:25.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点不对劲  指数从没跳到那么高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's wrong. It never gets this high.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.25,0:50:26.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's she doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.96,0:50:28.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.26,0:50:32.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在做梦吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is she dreaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.27,0:50:41.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希  我是妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy, it's Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.27,0:50:45.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.51,0:50:46.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她的头发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.28,0:50:47.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请让一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.98,0:50:49.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个会有助于她睡眠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This'll help you sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.28,0:50:53.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪  她的手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God, her arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.65,0:50:54.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快止血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get something.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.78,0:50:56.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了  宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened, baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.82,0:50:58.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.29,0:51:05.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.30,0:51:09.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在梦里带了东西出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought something out from my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.30,0:51:13.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是哪里来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.30,0:51:17.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从他头上扯下来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I grabbed it off his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.32,0:51:33.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说是在梦里从他头上扯下来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She said she grabbed it off his head in her dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.32,0:51:34.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  我没有疯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm not crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.92,0:51:37.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在就拿着那顶帽子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm holding the damn thing right here in my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.33,0:51:39.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道她在那里弄来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know where she really found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.33,0:51:43.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先挂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.34,0:51:56.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你昨天都没睡吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't sleep at all last night, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.48,0:51:59.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大夫说一定要睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know the doctor says you have to sleep, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.35,0:52:01.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样我会更疯狂的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go even crazier?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.35,0:52:03.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你不会疯狂的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think you're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.35,0:52:07.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再喝咖啡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And stop drinking that damn coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.93,0:52:14.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有没有叫爸去查那顶帽子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, did you ask Daddy to have the hat examined?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.36,0:52:18.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把那脏东西丢掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I threw that filthy thing away.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.37,0:52:20.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你在哪里找来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know where you really found it...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.37,0:52:21.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不知道你要证明什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or what you're trying to prove.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.37,0:52:22.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在睡眠中心学到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I learned in the dream clinic...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.37,0:52:26.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是要寻找证据来证明  妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's what I'm trying to prove, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.38,0:52:29.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗德没杀死蒂娜  他也没上吊自杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rod didn't kill Tina, and he didn't hang himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.35,0:52:34.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.38,0:52:38.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在梦里追杀我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's after us in our dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.39,0:52:43.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是真实的  南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's just not reality, Nancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.39,0:52:45.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是真的  妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's real, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.39,0:52:47.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你摸摸看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.40,0:52:48.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我那鬼东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me that damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.40,0:52:50.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帽子里还写有他的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It even has his name written in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.77,0:52:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佛莱迪  克鲁格  妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fred Krueger, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.40,0:52:57.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道那是谁吗  妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know who that is, Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.41,0:52:59.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你知道你最好告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because if you do, you better tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.41,0:53:01.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他现在正在追杀我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because he's after me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.41,0:53:05.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希  你就相信妈妈一次吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy, trust your mother for once, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.41,0:53:07.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你睡觉以后会觉得好一点的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll feel better when you get some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.42,0:53:09.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feel better?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.42,0:53:12.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也叫好点吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You call this feeling better?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.42,0:53:14.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许我真该和你一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or maybe I should grab that bottle and veg out with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.43,0:53:20.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整天一醉方休  我好好做个乖乖女  你就万事无忧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Avoid everything happening to me by just getting good and loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.44,0:53:30.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佛莱迪不可能追杀你  南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fred Krueger can't come after you, Nancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.44,0:53:33.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他死了  相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dead. Believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.44,0:53:34.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.91,0:53:38.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来你早就知道这个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knew about him all this time...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.61,0:53:39.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你却只当我一直在胡说八道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you've been acting like it was something I made up?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.45,0:53:44.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希  你病了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy, you're sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.02,0:53:46.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你出了点小毛病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something wrong with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.46,0:53:48.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在胡思乱想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're imagining things.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.46,0:53:50.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你睡觉后应该会觉得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll feel better when you sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.46,0:53:53.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just as simple as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.46,0:53:57.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Screw sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.47,0:54:03.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只是个恶梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.47,0:54:07.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.48,0:54:17.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一紧张便狂吃东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whenever I get nervous, I eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.49,0:54:20.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没东西吃时便睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you can't do that, you sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.49,0:54:22.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以前也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.49,0:54:26.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.50,0:54:31.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听过巴厘岛土著的做梦方式吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you ever read about the Balinese way of dreaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.50,0:54:38.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们有一套做梦技巧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They got this whole system they call dream skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.51,0:54:42.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如我做梦时  例如梦到我往下坠落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if you have a nightmare, for instance, like falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.51,0:54:43.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.88,0:54:48.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说除了吓得大叫外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, instead of screaming and getting all nuts...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.52,0:54:50.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还可以说  我要改变想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you say, "I'm going to make up my mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.52,0:54:53.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正跌入魔法世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"that I fall into a magic world."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.52,0:54:55.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们把恶梦变成美梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make it something special like a poem or a song.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.53,0:55:00.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的文学  艺术都由梦境而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They get all their art and literature from dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.53,0:55:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一睡醒便立刻将所梦到的记下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just wake up and write it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.70,0:55:04.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是做梦技巧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dream skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.37,0:55:08.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果在梦中遇到怪物怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if they meet a monster in their dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.54,0:55:09.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会远离怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They turn their back on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.97,0:55:11.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夺走怪物的力量  令它消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take away its energy, and it disappears.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.87,0:55:15.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不这样做会如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what happens if they don't do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.54,0:55:18.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些人可能就无法醒来跟你现身说法了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I guess those people don't wake up to tell what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.55,0:55:22.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.55,0:55:28.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,害人陷阱及伤人装置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Booby Traps & lmprovised Anti-Personnel Devices"?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.56,0:55:31.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么看这种书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you reading that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.56,0:55:35.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想存活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm into survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.56,0:55:36.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.57,0:55:40.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我越来越担心你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're starting to scare me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.58,0:55:53.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.61,0:56:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.32,0:56:32.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些铁栏是怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's with the bars?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.32,0:56:33.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以防安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Security.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.32,0:56:36.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以防什么安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Security from what?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.32,0:56:40.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不防什么  是防人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not from what, from whom.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.33,0:56:45.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟我来地窖  我们慢慢谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come down to the cellar with me, and I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.89,0:57:09.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想知道谁是佛莱迪  克鲁格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to know who Fred Krueger was?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.36,0:57:11.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个专杀小孩的变态杀手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a filthy child murderer...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.36,0:57:14.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少在这附近杀了二十个小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who killed at least 20 kids in the neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.36,0:57:17.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全都是街坊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kids we all knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.37,0:57:20.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.37,0:57:21.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不知道凶手是他时  都很害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It drove us crazy when we didn't know who it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.37,0:57:27.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他被捕后  情况更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it was even worse after they caught him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.38,0:57:36.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们放了他吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did they put him away?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.38,0:57:38.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,律师赚了大钱  法官也出了名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lawyers got fat and the judge got famous...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.39,0:57:42.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是有人忘了在逮捕令的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but somebody forgot to sign the search warrant...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.39,0:57:43.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,适当地方上签名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the right place...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.99,0:57:45.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是克鲁格就这样逍遥法外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Krueger was free just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.39,0:57:48.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们后来怎么做了  妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you do, Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.66,0:57:51.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们好些家长四处去寻找他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bunch of us parents tracked him down...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.40,0:57:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想把他逮回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after they let him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.40,0:57:56.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后在废弃的锅炉房里找到了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found him in an old abandoned boiler room...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.40,0:58:00.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他常抓小孩去那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where he used to take his kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.41,0:58:02.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.74,0:58:07.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们把汽油  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We took gasoline...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.42,0:58:08.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倒满在锅炉房四周  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We poured it all around the place...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.42,0:58:12.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直倒到门外  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and made a trail of it out the door...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.42,0:58:16.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后一把火把那里烧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then lit the whole thing up and watched it burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.43,0:58:26.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不能来害你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he can't get you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.43,0:58:30.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他死了  宝贝  妈妈杀死了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dead, honey, because Mommy killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.44,0:58:36.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还拿走了他的刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I even took his knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.45,0:58:47.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it's OK now.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.46,0:58:52.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安心睡吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.47,0:59:06.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨  你好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, hi, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.47,0:59:08.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事  你站在窗前  让我看到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine. Stand by your window so I can see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.48,0:59:12.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听电话感觉好远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sound a million miles away.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.48,0:59:16.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在好多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.48,0:59:19.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今天看到你妈在保安店那里买东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see your mom went ape at the security store today.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.49,0:59:22.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你家现在就像座"古龙城堡"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look like the Prisoner of Zenda or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.49,0:59:24.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你多久没睡过觉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long's it been since you slept?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.89,0:59:25.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是第七天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's coming up on the seventh day.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.49,0:59:28.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我查过健力士记录了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's OK. I checked Guinness.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.93,0:59:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是11天我知道他是谁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The record's 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.50,0:59:31.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着  格伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, Glen, I know who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.50,0:59:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.50,0:59:36.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.14,0:59:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真的  - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You do? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.51,0:59:39.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他杀了我后一定就会找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if he gets me, I'm pretty sure you're next.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.51,0:59:43.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么人人都想杀我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would anybody want to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.24,0:59:44.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.51,0:59:46.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之我要拉他出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just give me some help nailing the guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.92,0:59:47.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要帮我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when I bring him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.52,0:59:49.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他拉出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring him out of what?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.72,0:59:51.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拉出梦境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.52,0:59:53.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you plan to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.52,0:59:54.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像拿那顶帽子一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just like I did the hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.52,0:59:57.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我抓住他时  你叫醒我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have a hold of the sucker when you wake me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.53,0:59:59.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.53,1:00:02.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梦里的人怎么可能拉出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't bring somebody out of a dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.20,1:00:03.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也希望我做不到  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I can't, then you can all relax...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.53,1:00:05.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为那就表示我只是疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because it's just a case of me being nuts.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.67,1:00:08.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can save you the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.54,1:00:10.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一向疯疯癫癫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're nutty as a fruitcake.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.54,1:00:11.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我还是喜欢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you anyway.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.54,1:00:12.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.54,1:00:15.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把他从梦里拉出来后  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you won't mind cold-cocking this guy...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.54,1:00:16.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就痛扁他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when I bring him out.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.54,1:00:17.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.55,1:00:19.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You heard me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.55,1:00:20.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把那家伙拉出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I grab the guy in my dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.88,1:00:21.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到我挣扎  就把我叫醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see me struggling, so you wake me up.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.55,1:00:23.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都出来后  你就痛扁那混蛋  把他逮住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We both come out, you whack the fucker, and we got him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.55,1:00:27.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你疯了吗  我用什么打他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you crazy? Hit him with what?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.99,1:00:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿出点男人气概来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the jock.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.29,1:00:31.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用棒球棍什么都好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a baseball bat or something.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.56,1:00:34.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你午夜时分来我家楼下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just meet me at my porch at midnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.56,1:00:36.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有就是  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and meanwhile...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.57,1:00:38.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Meanwhile?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.70,1:00:44.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎么样  你都不能睡着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever you do, don't fall asleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.57,1:00:50.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,午夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Midnight?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.59,1:00:59.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噢  老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.59,1:01:01.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,午夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Midnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.59,1:01:04.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用棒球棍打妖魔鬼怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baseball bats and bogeymen.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.59,1:01:08.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.62,1:01:38.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.64,1:01:51.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么一边看电视  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you listen to television...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.24,1:01:53.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一边听歌呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and hear your records at the same time?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.64,1:01:55.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不用听电视声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I wasn't listening to the tube, Ma.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.64,1:01:56.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just watching.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.64,1:01:59.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚有美国小姐诞生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Nude America is going to be on tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.78,1:02:02.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么听到她的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How can you hear what she's going to say?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.65,1:02:04.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人会听她说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who cares what she says?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.65,1:02:06.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小鬼头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be such a smart guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.65,1:02:08.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快睡觉  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.79,1:02:10.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快午夜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's almost midnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.66,1:02:13.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快休息吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodness knows we've all had a lot to deal with...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.33,1:02:14.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这几天大家都忙坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}these last few days.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.66,1:02:15.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会的  妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.66,1:02:16.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们也睡了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys turning in?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.66,1:02:18.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretty soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.43,1:02:19.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快上床睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now get to bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.68,1:02:32.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结束了  宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over now, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.68,1:02:34.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恶梦结束了  睡吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The nightmare's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.78,1:02:35.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.76,1:03:59.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别盯着看了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't stare.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.77,1:04:02.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我在想什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I think?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.77,1:04:06.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得那个女孩有点精神失常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that kid is some kind of lunatic.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.01,1:04:10.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这么说人家  已经够可怜的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't talk that way about that poor child.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.78,1:04:12.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看那些铁栏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean those bars?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.21,1:04:14.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马奇只是出于安全起见  现在就她们母女二人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marge is just being cautious with her being all alone...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.78,1:04:21.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希最近又精神紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Nancy acting so nervous lately.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.79,1:04:22.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不管你说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care what you say.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.79,1:04:26.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想再让她再粘着我们的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want that kid hanging around with our son anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.84,1:05:20.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格伦  快接电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glen, answer the phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.85,1:05:27.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.86,1:05:29.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是她  她要找格伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's her. She wants to talk to Glen.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.86,1:05:32.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About what?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.86,1:05:36.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有什么事  南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this about, Nancy?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.86,1:05:38.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.87,1:05:40.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说这是私人的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She says it's private.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.87,1:05:43.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,私人的事  很重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very private and very important.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.87,1:05:44.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电话给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.87,1:05:47.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格伦睡了  明天再打来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Glen's asleep. You'll have to talk to him tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.88,1:05:49.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对待小孩子不能太温柔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've just got to be firm with these kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.88,1:05:51.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.01,1:05:52.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As a matter of fact...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.89,1:06:06.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.90,1:06:12.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要睡着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't fall asleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.92,1:06:39.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:39.93,1:06:43.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果格伦打电话来怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if Glen tries to call?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.97,1:07:21.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是你的男友了  南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm your boyfriend now, Nancy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.98,1:07:36.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的男友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.86,1:07:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.99,1:07:46.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,锁上了  锁上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Locked, locked, locked, locked.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.99,1:07:48.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我锁上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I locked it all up.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.53,1:07:50.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我必须如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.00,1:07:53.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希  除非你今晚睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy, you are going to get some sleep tonight...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.03,1:07:54.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖听话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if it kills me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.00,1:07:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,钥匙给我  妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the key, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.00,1:07:59.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  我根本没带在身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't. I don't even have it on me. See?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.61,1:08:02.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.02,1:08:13.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是午夜时分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is now 12 midnight...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.02,1:08:17.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你收听的是KRGR电台空中节目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and this is station KRGR leaving the air.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.03,1:08:28.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命  妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.07,1:09:11.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快  法兰克  来帮个忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Frank. I'll give you a hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.08,1:09:14.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用拿担架了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't need a stretcher up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.08,1:09:18.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿个拖把吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll need a mop.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.09,1:09:28.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是那种案件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't tell me it's another one.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.10,1:09:30.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤母森警官  对不起  把你吵醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant Thompson, I'm sorry to wake you...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.10,1:09:33.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我从没遇到过这种事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I've never seen anything like this before in my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.10,1:09:34.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,简直是闻所未闻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I knew this is your neighborhood...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.10,1:09:36.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是他们的邻居  所以我就想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I thought I'd better call you right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.17,1:09:39.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好找你来看看  验尸官在上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The coroner's upstairs now, but I don't think that he's...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.13,1:10:01.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.06,1:10:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  我这就叫他来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get him right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.13,1:10:10.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长  是你女儿的电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant, it's your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.51,1:10:20.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.55,1:10:23.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道来龙去脉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.15,1:10:25.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还没上楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I haven't been upstairs yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.15,1:10:28.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道他死了  对不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you know he's dead, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.16,1:10:32.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对  显然是死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Apparently he's dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.16,1:10:36.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸  我有方法帮你破案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, Daddy, I've got a proposition for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.16,1:10:38.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你注意听\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen very carefully, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.17,1:10:42.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会去帮你把凶手拉出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to go and get the guy who did it...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.60,1:10:44.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把他拉出来时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I want you to be there to arrest him...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.17,1:10:46.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就当场抓住他  好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when I bring him out, OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.17,1:10:49.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我是谁干的  我去抓他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just tell me who did it. I'll go get him, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.34,1:10:52.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是弗雷德  克鲁格干的  爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fred Krueger did it, Daddy...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.18,1:10:54.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有我能抓住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and only I can get him.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.18,1:10:56.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一直在我梦里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my nightmare he comes to.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.18,1:10:58.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且想追杀我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just come here and break the door down...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.19,1:11:02.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,20分钟后过来撞开我房门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in exactly 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.19,1:11:05.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 可以吗  - 没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you do that? - Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.19,1:11:09.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要准时在12点半的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That'll be exactly half past midnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.27,1:11:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚好够我睡着和把他拉出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time enough for me to fall asleep and find him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.24,1:11:16.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宝贝  你先去睡吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honey, you just do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.94,1:11:17.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get yourself some sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.01,1:11:19.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我经常叫你好好休息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I've been telling you all along.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.47,1:11:21.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真的会上来抓他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you'll be here to catch him?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.04,1:11:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长  他们在楼上等你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant, they're waiting for you upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.18,1:11:25.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的  我会去的  宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, I'll be there, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.05,1:11:27.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在  你快去休息吧  知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just get yourself some rest... please?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.08,1:11:28.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deal?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.58,1:11:31.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你  宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.86,1:11:39.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去看着我女儿的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go outside and watch my daughter's house.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.19,1:11:41.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有事发生便找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you see anything funny, call me.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.06,1:11:42.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会有什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything funny, like what?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.50,1:11:43.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.80,1:11:46.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之  我不想她来这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One thing for sure, I don't want her coming over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.97,1:11:49.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她还不懂得处理这种情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's too far gone to be able to handle this.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.31,1:13:10.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么东西干的  队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell did that, Lieutenant?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.32,1:13:12.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.32,1:13:13.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,验尸官怎么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What has the coroner got to say?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.32,1:13:17.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他看到这番场景时就吐得不行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in the john puking since he saw it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.33,1:13:25.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该一早告诉你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess I should have told you about him then.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.33,1:13:27.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去睡吧  妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just get some sleep, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.77,1:13:28.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's going to be OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.34,1:13:32.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只想保护你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just trying to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.34,1:13:36.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没想到这消息对你那么重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't see how much you needed to know.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.34,1:13:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很勇敢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You face things.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.35,1:13:42.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是天性来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's your nature.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.35,1:13:44.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你的天赋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's your gift...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.45,1:13:49.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但有时候你也必须逃避\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but sometime you have to turn away, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.37,1:14:04.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.37,1:14:09.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也爱你  宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, too, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.39,1:14:27.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Night.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.40,1:14:32.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧  克鲁格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, Krueger.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.40,1:14:36.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就来会一会你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We play on your court.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.42,1:14:52.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我躺下睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now I lay me down to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.42,1:14:55.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我向上帝祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pray the Lord my soul to keep...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.42,1:14:58.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我没办法醒来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and if I die before I wake...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.43,1:15:02.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愿主让我灵魂得到安息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pray the Lord my soul to take.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.77,1:15:07.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,倒计时开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Countdown mode.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.60,1:15:09.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时限10分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ten minutes and counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.45,1:15:24.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果在梦里遇到怪物怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if they meet a monster in their dreams?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.45,1:15:27.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,背向他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They turn their back on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.09,1:15:28.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用尽力气  他就会消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take away it's energy, and it disappears.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.46,1:15:30.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果没有用呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happens if they don't do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.46,1:15:34.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些人可能就无法醒来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I guess those people don't wake up to tell what happens.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.95,1:17:06.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你现身说法了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You dreamed about the same creep I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.55,1:17:10.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gonna get you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.62,1:18:16.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.73,1:20:05.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快给我出来  混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come out and show yourself, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.47,1:20:11.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.04,1:20:17.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来啊  克鲁格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Krueger!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.21,1:20:19.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追我啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.75,1:20:26.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.75,1:20:29.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.76,1:20:32.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在哪里  克鲁格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you, Krueger?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.76,1:20:36.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.76,1:20:38.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后十秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Final 10 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.77,1:20:42.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九  八  七  六  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine, eight, seven, six...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.80,1:20:43.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.74,1:20:48.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我抓到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got you now!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.80,1:21:21.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我疯了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm crazy after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.82,1:21:35.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门开着的  克鲁格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Krueger!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.82,1:21:39.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追我啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it down! Come and get me!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.83,1:21:43.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.83,1:21:44.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我抓到他了  爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got him! Hey, Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.80,1:21:46.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我困住他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got him trapped!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.83,1:21:47.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命  你在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.83,1:21:49.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's gonna be all right!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.84,1:21:51.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们会处理好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything's under control!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.84,1:21:55.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫我爸来  混帐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get my dad, you asshole!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.85,1:22:06.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.85,1:22:08.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's in here!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.19,1:22:10.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让他杀我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let him kill me, too!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.87,1:22:26.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.24,1:22:27.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来抓我啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't you catch me?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.88,1:22:33.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要把你碎尸万段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to split you in two.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.89,1:22:44.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸  救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy, help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.89,1:22:48.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我得去找队长来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I better go tell the Lieutenant.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.90,1:23:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要让你慢慢死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll kill you slow.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.91,1:23:06.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.94,1:23:40.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸  我抓到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy, I did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.95,1:23:44.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来  爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.95,1:23:48.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.96,1:23:52.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帕克  快找人来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parker, I need some help here!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.39,1:23:53.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  你们几个快来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, you guys. Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.86,1:23:54.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. Al, Tim, get over here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.96,1:24:02.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快开门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get you out.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.07,1:24:03.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,门开着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open this door!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.74,1:24:04.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保护好自己  我来抓他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch yourself. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.97,1:24:07.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,克鲁格在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Krueger!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.31,1:24:08.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.98,1:24:17.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到这里来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way, guys. Come down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.99,1:24:21.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.49,1:24:21.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南希  到底出什么事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nancy, what the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.99,1:24:23.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帕克  快上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Parker, get up here!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.99,1:24:26.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来帮忙救火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a fire up here, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.43,1:24:29.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're on our way up.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.00,1:24:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是怎么回事  南希\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is going on, Nancy?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.00,1:24:37.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他去找妈了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's after Mother!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.01,1:24:51.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心  他就在下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out! He's under there!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.34,1:25:21.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在相信我了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now do you believe me?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.35,1:25:23.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们在楼下救火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've got the fires out downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.35,1:25:27.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里不要紧吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything OK up here?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.36,1:25:40.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.37,1:25:42.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你先下楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.37,1:25:46.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我马上下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be there in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.38,1:25:52.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的没事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant, is everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.38,1:25:53.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别问我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.41,1:26:30.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你在这里  佛莱迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're there, Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.42,1:26:35.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为你能逃得掉吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think you was gonna get away from me?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.42,1:26:39.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也了解你了  佛莱迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you too well now, Freddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.73,1:26:43.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要你死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.86,1:26:46.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太迟了  克鲁格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too late, Krueger.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.73,1:26:49.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你的死穴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the secret now.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.74,1:26:52.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这只是个梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.74,1:26:54.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你并不存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.74,1:26:59.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整件事是一场梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This whole thing is just a dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.75,1:27:03.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要我妈妈和朋友都回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want my mother and friends again.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.75,1:27:05.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You what?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.75,1:27:09.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要收回我给你的一切力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I take back every bit of energy I gave you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.76,1:27:14.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什么都不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.76,1:27:19.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,垃圾不如\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.78,1:27:35.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是惊喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's bright.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.82,1:27:39.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阳光普照  很快就会热的了  当心晒伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's going to burn off soon, or it wouldn't be so bright.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.79,1:27:41.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好一点了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feeling better?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.79,1:27:43.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好得不得了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I feel like a million bucks.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.79,1:27:45.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们说睡得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say you've bottomed out...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.76,1:27:47.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自然会记不起昨晚的梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you can't remember the night before.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.79,1:27:50.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我要戒酒了  宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, baby, I'm going to stop drinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.53,1:27:52.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好像不再爱喝酒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just don't feel like it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.80,1:27:54.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我昨晚吵醒你了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I keep you awake last night?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.80,1:27:58.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你精神有点不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look a little bit peaked.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.81,1:28:03.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我睡得非常好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess I just slept heavy.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.81,1:28:07.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回头见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.81,1:28:11.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回头见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.82,1:28:14.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.82,1:28:15.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么起雾了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You believe this fog?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.82,1:28:18.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事都有可能发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believe anything is possible.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.43,1:28:21.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你今天好靓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looking good, girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.83,1:28:25.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.83,1:28:28.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.27,1:28:30.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么都没做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I'm not doing this.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.90,1:28:31.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格伦  快让我们出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us out!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.84,1:28:32.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我关的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not doing this.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.91,1:28:34.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车窗怎么关上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on with the window?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.84,1:28:38.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Mother!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.51,1:28:42.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.85,1:28:52.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一  二  佛莱迪要来抓你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, two... Freddy's coming for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.43,1:28:59.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三  四  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three, four...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.06,1:29:02.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好把门锁紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better lock your door.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.57,1:29:05.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五  六  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five, six...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.10,1:29:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去拿十字架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab your crucifix.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.31,1:29:10.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七  八  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven, eight...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.11,1:29:13.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彻夜不眠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gonna stay up late.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.18,1:29:15.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九  十  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine, ten...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.55,1:29:19.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永远不要睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never sleep again.
